comment.narrative:
The final target has achieved. The five plans are: 
Tanchang County: Master Plan for Greater Guan'egou Scenic Zone; 
Kang County: Plan for Yangba Scenic Zone; 
Jingchuan County: Conservation and Operation Plan for the Hundred Miles Buddhist Grottoes;
Hezheng County: Promotion Plan for Hezheng local Hua'er Opera;
Jingtai County: Operation Plan for the Jingtai Ancient City Visitor Center.
These plans have been adopted by the participating counties and are fully funded by the relevant county budgets. 
Source: Social Development M&E Report
